    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32945" root="فتك" body-key="f">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفتّك بِأَمْرِهِ</span></b>  <i>He executed,</i> or <i>performed, his
affair;</i> or <i>kept,</i> or <i>applied himself, constantly,</i>
or <i>perseveringly, to it; not consulting any one.</i>
(ISh, O, K.)

